# Demo 1-1 line: World 1-1 goal and save qualification.
# Assisted route: air-swim and invulnerability fixtures carry Mario to the level's
# far end, where the goal tape stands on the end platform at x~0x16DC, y=0x140.
# Goal contact, course-clear event writes and the map return are performed by the
# game, not injected. This is not an unassisted traversal.
wait 600
press start 2
wait 180
press start 2
wait 900
press b 30
wait 180
press a 30
wait 180
poke 0109 00

# Practice map transfer: map 0, X=0x048, Y=0x198 (the 1-1 node).
poke 1f11 0000
poke 1f17 4800980148009801
poke 1f1f 0400190004001900
poke 0100 0b
wait 240
press y 2
until 0100 == 14 480

# Assisted flight to the far end; the fixture is labelled and disabled before
# the goal walk so the tape contact happens with normal physics.
# Labelled cheat: seed the bonus star counter to 99 so the goal tape star must
# supply the 100th. No other writes.
poke 0f48 63
wait 30
dump s99
forcepoke 85 01
poke 1490 60
poke 1497 ff
